                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaansa wapusama, mukuyu wafwa, misamu yapomegranite akakunka amibula, misamu yoonse yamusokwe, iliyumide. Lukondo loonse lwabamanina bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
