        },
        {
          "text": "Amusame zisamo zyakulila, nubapaizi. Amulile, nubasimilimo ba cipaililo. Kamuza kuzoolala azisani zyamasaka, nubasimilimo ba-Leza wangu, Nkaambo cituuzyo acipaizyo cakunywa zyoonse zyalesegwa kŋanda yaLeza wanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
