        },
        {
          "text": "Maawe! Buzuba bulaca! Buzuba bwaJehova buli afwaafwi. Buleza mbuli lunyonyooko kuzwa kujanza lyaSinguzuzyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
